### 1. Create a Barista
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "David",
  "email": "david@coffeeshop.com",
  "passwordHash": "hashed_password_123",
  "role": "BARISTA"
}

### 2. Schedule a Shift for Sarah (Assuming Sarah gets ID 1)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shifts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "staff": {
    "id": 3
  },
  "startTime": "2026-08-25T09:00:00Z",
  "endTime": "2026-08-25T17:00:00Z",
  "status": "scheduled"
}

### 3. Fetch Sarah's Schedule
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/shifts?staffId=3